{"strongs": "H0599", "word": "אָנֵף", "translit": "a.naph", "root": "אנף", "morph": "H:V", "pos": "verb", "gloss": "be angry", "definition": "[ אָנֵף , אָנַף ] verb (breathe, snort) be angry ( MI id. , compare Arabic Assyrian etc. in derivatives) ** in Hebrew, verb denominative from אַף . — Qal Perfect אָנַפְתָּ Ps 60:3 , etc.; Impefect יֶאֱנַף Ps 2:12 , etc.; — be angry , of ׳ י ; usually followed by בְּ 1Kgs 8:46 = 2Chr 6:36 ; Isa 12:1 ; Ps 85:6 ; Ezra 9:14 absolute Ps 60:3 ; Ps 79:5 compare also Ps 2:12 . Hithpa`el id. always followed by בְּ & always of ׳ י , Perfect הִתְאַנַּף Deut 1:37 ; Deut 4:21 ; Deut 9:20 Imperfect וַיִּתְאַנַּף Deut 9:8 ; 1Kgs 11:9 ; 2Kgs 17:18 .", "definition_html": "<h1><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB600')\">BDB600</entry> [<entry onclick=\"sn('H599')\">H599</entry>]</h1><div class=\"navigation\"><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB599')\">BDB599</entry> | BIBLICAL HEBREW | <entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB601')\">BDB601</entry></div><p> [<bdbheb>אָנֵף</bdbheb>, <bdbheb>אָנַף</bdbheb>] <b>verb</b> (breathe, snort) <highlightword>be angry</highlightword> (<lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('MI')\"><reflink>MI</reflink></lookup> <highlight>id.</highlight>, compare Arabic <placeholder309/> Assyrian etc. in derivatives) <div class=\"remarks\"><b>**</b>in Hebrew, verb denominative from <bdbheb>אַף</bdbheb>. — </div><div class=\"point\"><b>Qal</b> <highlight>Perfect</highlight> <bdbheb>אָנַפְתָּ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Ps 60:3\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"60\" vBegin=\"3\" cEnd=\"60\" vEnd=\"3\" onclick=\"bcv(19,60,3)\">Ps 60:3</ref>, etc.; <highlight>Impefect</highlight> <bdbheb>יֶאֱנַף</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Ps 2:12\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"2\" vBegin=\"12\" cEnd=\"2\" vEnd=\"12\" onclick=\"bcv(19,2,12)\">Ps 2:12</ref>, etc.; — <highlight>be angry</highlight>, of <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>י</bdbheb>; usually followed by <bdbheb>בְּ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"1Kgs 8:46\" b=\"11\" cBegin=\"8\" vBegin=\"46\" cEnd=\"8\" vEnd=\"46\" onclick=\"bcv(11,8,46)\">1Kgs 8:46</ref> = <ref ref=\"2Chr 6:36\" b=\"14\" cBegin=\"6\" vBegin=\"36\" cEnd=\"6\" vEnd=\"36\" onclick=\"bcv(14,6,36)\">2Chr 6:36</ref>; <ref ref=\"Isa 12:1\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"12\" vBegin=\"1\" cEnd=\"12\" vEnd=\"1\" onclick=\"bcv(23,12,1)\">Isa 12:1</ref>; <ref ref=\"Ps 85:6\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"85\" vBegin=\"6\" cEnd=\"85\" vEnd=\"6\" onclick=\"bcv(19,85,6)\">Ps 85:6</ref>; <ref ref=\"Ezra 9:14\" b=\"15\" cBegin=\"9\" vBegin=\"14\" cEnd=\"9\" vEnd=\"14\" onclick=\"bcv(15,9,14)\">Ezra 9:14</ref> absolute <ref ref=\"Ps 60:3\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"60\" vBegin=\"3\" cEnd=\"60\" vEnd=\"3\" onclick=\"bcv(19,60,3)\">Ps 60:3</ref>; <ref ref=\"Ps 79:5\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"79\" vBegin=\"5\" cEnd=\"79\" vEnd=\"5\" onclick=\"bcv(19,79,5)\">Ps 79:5</ref> compare also <ref ref=\"Ps 2:12\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"2\" vBegin=\"12\" cEnd=\"2\" vEnd=\"12\" onclick=\"bcv(19,2,12)\">Ps 2:12</ref>. <b>Hithpa`el</b> id. always followed by <bdbheb>בְּ</bdbheb> &amp; always of <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>י</bdbheb>, <highlight>Perfect</highlight> <bdbheb>הִתְאַנַּף</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Deut 1:37\" b=\"5\" cBegin=\"1\" vBegin=\"37\" cEnd=\"1\" vEnd=\"37\" onclick=\"bcv(5,1,37)\">Deut 1:37</ref>; <ref ref=\"Deut 4:21\" b=\"5\" cBegin=\"4\" vBegin=\"21\" cEnd=\"4\" vEnd=\"21\" onclick=\"bcv(5,4,21)\">Deut 4:21</ref>; <ref ref=\"Deut 9:20\" b=\"5\" cBegin=\"9\" vBegin=\"20\" cEnd=\"9\" vEnd=\"20\" onclick=\"bcv(5,9,20)\">Deut 9:20</ref> <highlight>Imperfect</highlight> <bdbheb>וַיִּתְאַנַּף</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Deut 9:8\" b=\"5\" cBegin=\"9\" vBegin=\"8\" cEnd=\"9\" vEnd=\"8\" onclick=\"bcv(5,9,8)\">Deut 9:8</ref>; <ref ref=\"1Kgs 11:9\" b=\"11\" cBegin=\"11\" vBegin=\"9\" cEnd=\"11\" vEnd=\"9\" onclick=\"bcv(11,11,9)\">1Kgs 11:9</ref>; <ref ref=\"2Kgs 17:18\" b=\"12\" cBegin=\"17\" vBegin=\"18\" cEnd=\"17\" vEnd=\"18\" onclick=\"bcv(12,17,18)\">2Kgs 17:18</ref>. </p></div><hr>", "references": [{"raw": "Ps 60:3", "book": "PSA", "chapter": 60, "verse": 3}, {"raw": "Ps 2:12", "book": "PSA", "chapter": 2, "verse": 12}, {"raw": "1Kgs 8:46", "book":